load_kv_stream` and `batch_decomp_stream` are separate, with the production\\n+two-slot HBM ring. The same `decompress_batch` API and cached plans are used.\\n+\\n+| N | CD3 whole-row | CD3 pipeline-1024 | Pipeline gain | P4Flat split | CD3 vs P4 |\\n+|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|\\n+| 1536 | 0.3087 | 0.2804 | 9.2% | not measured | -- |\\n+| 6000 | 1.1150 | 0.9626 | 13.7% | 1.2136 | 20.7% faster |\\n+\\n+The pipeline is enabled from 1,536 active blocks and chunks at 1,024 blocks.\\n+Both are environment-tunable. A fragmented plan that cannot stage each chunk\\n+as selected contiguous runs automatically uses the original single-copy path.\\n+\\n+## Correctness and integration\\n+\\n+- Default Packed20x3 exception capacity: 420 entries per K or V row.\\n+- Overflow: the true count remains in the row; either-side overflow restores\\n+  the K/V pair from authoritative raw `secondary_kv` and skips CD3 decode.\\n+- `tests/test_chunk_delta3.py`: 20/20 passed, including forced capacity-3\\n+  overflow and two-stream chunk plan coverage.\\n+- Offline smoke: `cao-cd3-fused-kvcomp`, batches 64/128, input 1020, output 2,\\n+  breakdown enabled. Planner reported `pb_comp=49,408`, pool slot 24,704, and\\n+  the suite exited PASS with clean GPU/hugepage boundaries.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a06186-6325-79b3-9454-03c11387a0a9","create_time":1788343539.930962}}}
