er L+1 H2D with layer L decode for N>=256. Smaller restores\\n   stay on one stream to avoid fixed event/stream overhead.\\n+- The default 420-entry exception capacity makes each K/V blob row 24,704\\n+  bytes. Overflow is losslessly restored from raw secondary KV, so this byte\\n+  reduction is not dependent on the sampled model's exception maximum.\\n+- From 1,536 active blocks, cached 1,024-block plans pipeline H2D of chunk\\n+  j+1 with decode of chunk j on the existing two-slot ring. Fragmented slot\\n+  sets that exceed the selected-run limit automatically keep one bulk copy.\\n@@\\n-- Reducing the fixed KV exception capacity from 768 to 384 saved bytes on the\\n-  sampled Llama KV cache, but was not retained: the observed maximum is not a\\n-  correctness bound, and there is no overflow-safe variable-row fallback.\\n+- Reducing capacity without a fallback was rejected. The retained 420-entry\\n+  row adds an overflow-safe raw-secondary path, so arbitrary inputs remain\\n+  bit-exact rather than relying on the sampled maximum.\\n@@\\n-| Fixed exception capacity 768 | Workload safety bound | Profile the target KV exception tail; do not reduce it without an overflow-safe fallback |\\n+| Compact capacity 420 + raw fallback | General correctness; workload affects fallback frequency | Profile the exception tail; raise capacity if fallback frequency makes raw restores expensive |\\n+| Intra-layer chunks 1024, minimum 1536 | GH200 transfer/launch tuning | Re-sweep both values on a different fabric/GPU; set chunk size to 0 to disable |\\n@@\\n - Final standalone and 16-layer KV logs:\\n   `/lambda/nfs/whchoi/experiment-results/cd3-20260901-route/kv_standalone_final_20260901.log`\\n   and `kv_pipeline16_final_20260901.log`\\n+- Compact-row and serving-scale pipeline results:\\n+  `/lambda/nfs/whchoi/experiment-results/cd3-20260901-route/KV_COMPACT_PIPELINE_20260902.md`\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a06186-6325-79b3-9454-03c11387a0a9","create_time":1788343555.996599}}}
